Feature: Example feature acceptance
  Business-readable behavior for one feature.

  Background:
    Given an authorized user can access the product area

  Scenario: User completes the primary workflow
    Given the required setup exists
    When the user completes the primary action
    Then the user sees the expected result
    And the result is still available when the user returns

  Scenario: Unauthorized user is blocked
    Given a user without the required permission
    When the user attempts the protected action
    Then the system denies the action
    And no protected data is exposed
